# Copy to .env.local and fill in. .env.local is gitignored — never commit real secrets.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ convention: any variable with this prefix is inlined into the
# browser bundle at build time, so it MUST be safe to be public. The Supabase
# URL and anon key are designed to be public (the anon key is gated by Row
# Level Security). The service role key has NO prefix: it bypasses RLS, stays
# server-side only, and must never reach the client bundle or git.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
